# `upgrade` reads this file from the tree it runs from, never from the tag it fetched,
# and refuses a tag no line here signed. A new key's line is added in a release the
# old key signs, and the old line is removed one release later, so a box one release
# behind still verifies. See docs/runbooks/release-files.md §12.
